{
  "type": "doc",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": null,
        "level": 1
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "The rise of edge computing: why the cloud is moving closer to you"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "For the past decade, we've been told to put everything in "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "italic"
            },
            {
              "type": "highlight",
              "attrs": {
                "color": "var(--tt-color-highlight-yellow)"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "the cloud"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": ". But as our devices grow smarter and our appetite for "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "real-time responsiveness"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": " grows, a new paradigm is taking hold — one where computation happens at the "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "bold"
            }
          ],
          "text": "edge"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": null
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Explore the full landscape of edge computing in the "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "attrs": {
                "href": "https://www.cloudflare.com/learning/serverless/glossary/what-is-edge-computing/",
                "target": "_blank",
                "rel": "noopener noreferrer nofollow",
                "class": null
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "Cloudflare Edge Computing Guide"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "codeBlock",
      "attrs": {
        "language": "bash"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "npx wrangler deploy my-edge-function --env production"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": null,
        "level": 2
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "What is edge computing?"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "blockquote",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "attrs": {
            "textAlign": null
          },
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "text": "Edge computing moves data processing physically closer to where it's generated — your phone, a factory sensor, or a traffic camera — instead of routing everything to a distant data center. Latency drops from "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "text": "~100ms"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "italic"
                }
              ],
              "text": " to as low as "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "code"
                }
              ],
              "text": "~1ms"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ". That's not just fast — that's "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "marks": [
                {
                  "type": "strike"
                }
              ],
              "text": "imperceptibly"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " instantaneous. ⚡"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "This shift enables a new class of applications — autonomous vehicles, AR/VR experiences, industrial automation — that simply "
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "marks": [
            {
              "type": "highlight",
              "attrs": {
                "color": "var(--tt-color-highlight-blue)"
              }
            }
          ],
          "text": "cannot tolerate cloud-roundtrip delays"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "attrs": {
        "src": "/images/edge-computing-diagram.jpg",
        "alt": "edge-computing-diagram",
        "title": "edge-computing-diagram"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "bulletList",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "Latency"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ": Edge nodes reduce round-trip time by up to 10"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "superscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "2"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "× vs. traditional cloud."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "Bandwidth savings"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ": Process data locally — only send the "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "result"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " upstream, not raw streams of H"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "subscript"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "2"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "O sensor data."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "listItem",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "attrs": {
                "textAlign": "left"
              },
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "Typographic note"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": ": Edge is sometimes written as "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "code"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "->"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " cloud, meaning data flows "
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ],
                  "text": "→"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "text": " only when needed."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
