      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Build your own edge function"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "attrs": {
        "textAlign": "left"
      },
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "Getting started is surprisingly accessible. Platforms like Cloudflare Workers, Vercel Edge, and AWS Lambda@Edge let you deploy serverless functions globally in minutes, with custom CSS and logic running close to every user."
        }
      ]
    },
